64
00:07:30,408 --> 00:07:33,008
Did you enjoy my lovely song?

65
00:07:33,808 --> 00:07:35,408
I hope you did.

66
00:07:35,608 --> 00:07:38,108
It was for you, after all.

67
00:07:40,108 --> 00:07:42,408
Why are you not smiling?

68
00:07:42,708 --> 00:07:44,808
Are you not happy to see me?

69
00:07:46,608 --> 00:07:47,908
Well...

70
00:07:48,908 --> 00:07:50,008
Say something.

71
00:07:50,408 --> 00:07:51,208
Answer me.

72
00:07:51,608 --> 00:07:53,408
Who... who are you?

73
00:07:53,908 --> 00:07:54,608
What?

74
00:07:55,008 --> 00:07:57,708
You don't know who I am?

75
00:07:58,008 --> 00:08:02,708
But everyone knows... you are the one that released me, right?

76
00:08:03,308 --> 00:08:05,708
I'm... I'm sorry.

77
00:08:06,008 --> 00:08:07,208
You're sorry?

78
00:08:07,708 --> 00:08:09,708
For what? For releasing me?

79
00:08:10,408 --> 00:08:13,308
No, no, no. For upsetting you.

80
00:08:13,508 --> 00:08:16,708
If I said something wrong, I apologize.

81
00:08:17,008 --> 00:08:18,208
Apologize?

82
00:08:18,508 --> 00:08:23,008
You, who should be amongst my most dearest and beloved followers...

83
00:08:23,608 --> 00:08:29,608
...who has freed me from that prison, who has shown me your love above all others...

84
00:08:29,908 --> 00:08:33,808
...you then act like you don't even know who I am?

85
00:08:34,308 --> 00:08:37,108
Why would you toy with my emotions?

86
00:08:37,308 --> 00:08:40,108
I'm... I'm sorry. I'm not sure what you mean.

87
00:08:40,608 --> 00:08:42,008
You're not sure what I mean?

88
00:08:42,408 --> 00:08:44,808
Are you mocking me now?

89
00:08:45,008 --> 00:08:50,408
If you truly do not know who I am, then why is it that you set me free?

90
00:08:50,608 --> 00:08:55,908
If not for my love, and if not by your love, then for what?

91
00:08:56,108 --> 00:08:59,308
Tell me the truth, and the whole truth, now!

92
00:08:59,608 --> 00:09:02,808
No more lies, or there will be consequences!

93
00:09:03,308 --> 00:09:17,408
I-I'm not lying. I swear to you, I have no idea how I released you. I just came to a temple to collect rare spices and memories from the many books stored away here. By the gods, that's the whole truth!

94
00:09:17,708 --> 00:09:20,708
Extract memories from books?

95
00:09:21,108 --> 00:09:26,108
Are you telling me you're a witch? How dare you step foot here?

96
00:09:26,408 --> 00:09:36,808
Even knowing the long history between demons and witches, you still dare step foot here? I know how witches dare to try and bind my kind.

97
00:09:37,208 --> 00:09:42,108
Would you be foolish enough to dare attempt that on me?

98
00:09:42,408 --> 00:10:03,608
Yeah, it's okay. Yes, I'm a witch, but I've never... well, mostly never tried anything like that. I... I swear. And this time, I was not let on by my nature at all. No. This time, it was an angel that told me of this place. An angel came to me in my dreams.

99
00:10:05,075 --> 00:10:08,715
Told me of an enchanted book with centuries of memories stowed away here.

100
00:10:08,845 --> 00:10:13,325
Can you imagine the knowledge and stories hidden in centuries of memories?

101
00:10:13,865 --> 00:10:18,185
With a prize like that, I had to come find a book, no matter the danger.

102
00:10:18,995 --> 00:10:22,655
Little could I have known the true nature of the book, though.

103
00:10:22,905 --> 00:10:25,345
Enough! I've heard enough!

104
00:10:25,805 --> 00:10:30,345
I believe you are who you say you are, a witch.

105
00:10:30,615 --> 00:10:33,735
But I don't fully believe your childish story.

106
00:10:33,985 --> 00:10:37,645
No angel would ever lead a witch to such a dangerous book.

107
00:10:37,975 --> 00:10:43,005
And I can hardly believe it's just the book and not myself you are after.

108
00:10:43,745 --> 00:10:47,345
It... it's true! An angel came to me in my dreams...

109
00:10:47,865 --> 00:10:58,445
...and told me to come here. I was drawn to that book with all its power and stories, and, well, I guess you inside it.

110
00:10:58,835 --> 00:11:01,945
The powerful aura you gave off drew me right to it.

111
00:11:02,175 --> 00:11:09,455
How was I to know that the aura was thanks to a demon trapped within its pages? Who would've guessed?

112
00:11:09,855 --> 00:11:15,345
Though, now that I recall my story, it does seem it really was me who released you.

113
00:11:15,885 --> 00:11:22,335
Speaking of coming and going, now that you are free, I think it is time I take my leave of this place.

114
00:11:22,815 --> 00:11:26,655
I'm glad I was able to help free you from... from once again...

115
00:11:26,845 --> 00:11:30,505
I didn't say you could leave!

116
00:11:32,175 --> 00:11:38,775
You may leave when I say you can leave, and stop your nervous fidgeting. I'm no fool.

117
00:11:40,595 --> 00:11:44,655
You think I didn't see you reaching for your book of magic?

118
00:11:44,925 --> 00:11:53,185
You, a witch, should know better than anyone that no amount of magic is powerful enough to destroy a demon of my power.

119
00:11:53,785 --> 00:12:00,725
However, you can take some small solace in the fact that if I had wanted you dead, you'd already be so.

120
00:12:00,725 --> 00:12:06,635
The only reason you're still alive is because you helped free me.

121
00:12:06,905 --> 00:12:19,405
Alas, I cannot allow a witch who so obviously came with the intent to bind me to her will leave here freely.

122
00:12:19,675 --> 00:12:25,325
Your story did little to convince me your aims were otherwise, so I will give you an ultimatum.

123
00:12:25,835 --> 00:12:28,405
You serve me here in my hollow temple.

124
00:12:28,505 --> 00:12:31,905
Love me, adore me, worship me...

125
00:12:32,175 --> 00:12:37,405
...every living day, give me all the love you have,

126
00:12:37,635 --> 00:12:42,205
or I can take your soul right now. Your choice.

127
00:12:43,005 --> 00:12:46,635
Kiara... I need you.

128
00:13:03,455 --> 00:13:07,755
[Title: Be My Guest]

129
00:13:07,955 --> 00:13:11,355
Lost in the rain with no umbrella, night snaps out your eyes

130
00:13:11,355 --> 00:13:17,455
Can't seem to find your way back home, come in and be my guest

131
00:13:18,455 --> 00:13:25,555
Such a lovely smile spread across your face, but it's simply forgery

132
00:13:25,855 --> 00:13:32,855
If you need to hide from the world outside, why not try to be my guest

133
00:13:33,455 --> 00:13:37,955
Waiting all day long, but your friends don't come and you're left there all alone

134
00:13:37,955 --> 00:13:41,755
Still you can't jump off from the high rooftop

135
00:13:41,755 --> 00:13:47,555
So come on and be my guest

136
00:13:48,255 --> 00:13:51,755
Like a cat the way I snap and snap and snap

137
00:13:51,755 --> 00:13:55,555
We carefully stride, my feet go tap and tap and tap

138
00:13:55,555 --> 00:14:01,855
You'll follow nicely with the snap and snap and snap, so lovely you'll be mesmerized by me

139
00:14:02,455 --> 00:14:10,355
My institution's peaceful as can be, just mind the way that it seems, both our quotes and our supports will be concise, clear and clean

140
00:14:10,855 --> 00:14:18,155
Since we're only starting out, there's some improbabilities, but just listen up tonight, you'll have to stay up, please

141
00:14:18,155 --> 00:14:24,555
Though they don't like you when you know it's true, you're at their beck and call

142
00:14:24,755 --> 00:14:31,855
Since you're desperately given easily, come inside and be my guest

143
00:14:32,455 --> 00:14:39,055
You're the last to choose, but you're left confused, seems that someone took your share

144
00:14:39,255 --> 00:14:47,255
If you won't accuse 'cause you don't have proof, take a chance and be my guest

145
00:14:50,755 --> 00:15:00,755
On the way back home, there's a sweet aroma that tempts you off of your path, I can't help but laugh 'cause I know in fact...

146
00:15:31,123 --> 00:15:35,163
Demon! How dare you kill an innocent!

147
00:15:35,914 --> 00:15:39,184
Excuse me! I've done no such thing, innocent?

148
00:15:39,924 --> 00:15:42,194
I would hardly call a witch who lives for power and binds my kind for her own purposes "innocent."

149
00:15:51,714 --> 00:15:54,124
The very idea is laughable.

150
00:15:55,814 --> 00:16:01,994
Leave, I have no quarrel with you, so go now in peace before I change my mind. A small token for your past bravery and trials.

151
00:16:07,184 --> 00:16:11,944
How gracious. Don't think I can't see straight through your ploy still.

152
00:16:12,734 --> 00:16:17,254
You will not escape justice, not this time. You have brought this fight on yourself for your actions, demon.

153
00:16:22,014 --> 00:16:24,944
You have brought all of this on yourself... for what?

154
00:16:25,794 --> 00:16:28,184
For killing a mere witch?

155
00:16:28,734 --> 00:16:32,994
She was not just a witch! She was my friend, and a kind-hearted person.

156
00:16:35,734 --> 00:16:40,254
And you killed her... in cold blood!

157
00:16:40,824 --> 00:16:53,174
Oh, the legendary Phoenix, the mighty fiery Kiara, friends with a witch? It's almost funny. Did you not realize? It was your witch friend who freed me.

158
00:16:57,044 --> 00:17:06,004
Liar! She would never do such a ghastly thing! I trust she would stay away from dark magic and demonic rituals. To suggest otherwise is just another one of your dark lies.

159
00:17:11,734 --> 00:17:14,064
She didn't deserve to die.

160
00:17:14,504 --> 00:17:29,174
Poor Phoenix, still so trusting of those around you and unable to see through their deceptions. Your kind spirit constantly deceives you. That witch was never your friend.

161
00:17:30,164 --> 00:17:44,984
We all know they cannot be trusted. Even after all these years you still have not changed, still believing in lies and still so easily misled. Still such a fool!

162
00:17:45,734 --> 00:17:59,974
It is you who is the fool, demon! Your lust for love and attention continues to lead you down the path of death and destruction. And you don't even see that you're the one destroying your own happiness.

163
00:18:01,164 --> 00:18:13,204
The gods were right to confine you there, you who are still shackled by your lust for love. Your desire for attention, your desire to be worshipped...

164
00:18:13,894 --> 00:18:28,254
I am the demon of sound! How dare you speak to me in such a manner? It is but right that all should worship me on their knees, their love for none but myself!

165
00:18:29,064 --> 00:18:39,184
Leave! I have heard enough of your falsities. This is your last warning. Go now or you'll be left to rot here forever!

166
00:18:39,984 --> 00:18:59,184
I am not afraid of you, and I will heed no such warning. Listen, and listen well, demon. I will not allow you to claim any more victims. To be banished in a void was not sufficient enough punishment for you. No. Now, I will finish what the gods should have...

167
00:19:01,144 --> 00:19:06,174
...done!

168
00:19:11,855 --> 00:19:16,825
Fly, make a move! I didn't mean to wish

169
00:19:17,125 --> 00:19:21,855
Once in a lifetime, come on, what will you bet? I ask myself

170
00:19:21,855 --> 00:19:26,155
Will I win or will I lose? There's no such thing as a draw

171
00:19:26,155 --> 00:19:29,825
Ah, ah, ah, yeah, the curtain rises!

172
00:19:29,825 --> 00:19:34,025
Kachin' and lucky money, neither of them is free, cigar, cigar

173
00:19:34,025 --> 00:19:37,825
Will you pull it off, it's all up to you

174
00:19:37,825 --> 00:19:41,825
Move aside! I'm the one who'll snatch the ace away

175
00:19:45,855 --> 00:19:52,855
Stay with me, all that will change, you'll see. Not here to play, don't get in my way, I'm tired of talking

176
00:19:52,855 --> 00:20:00,050
One, two, three, one, two, three, one, two, three, sit down, sit down

177
00:20:00,469 --> 00:20:01,719
1, 2, 3

178
00:20:02,079 --> 00:20:03,349
Mm, I got skills as cold as ice

179
00:20:03,349 --> 00:20:05,499
You gotta throw your hands up if you can't decide

180
00:20:05,499 --> 00:20:08,899
Gonna scare you off as I roll the dice, huh?

181
00:20:09,199 --> 00:20:11,759
Pussies gonna say goodbye, yeah?

182
00:20:11,759 --> 00:20:14,739
Had enough? You make up love, but nothing, nothing else

183
00:20:15,119 --> 00:20:19,809
Need the light 'cause we can light it up, it up, it up

184
00:20:20,209 --> 00:20:23,579
I'm standing round, can't avoid the voices in my head

185
00:20:23,579 --> 00:20:27,769
No stopping now, I just gotta win this game instead

186
00:20:27,769 --> 00:20:31,599
Give us way...

187
00:20:31,599 --> 00:20:33,799
You bet, I'm here to stay

188
00:20:33,799 --> 00:20:37,749
And now it's time to learn your place

189
00:20:38,599 --> 00:20:40,509
Ha, streak is running

190
00:20:40,509 --> 00:20:42,689
Lucky money is smoking like a cigar, cigar

191
00:20:42,689 --> 00:20:47,729
Acting funny, answer if I'm quitting, well I'm not!

192
00:20:48,589 --> 00:20:52,689
Make your bets, black or red, chips to spend, yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah

193
00:20:52,689 --> 00:20:57,529
Break the stakes, play that ace, risk your life on a single game

194
00:20:57,529 --> 00:21:02,039
Stay with me, yeah, yeah, yeah, you'll change, you'll see

195
00:21:02,039 --> 00:21:04,939
Not here to play, don't get in my way, I've always counted

196
00:21:05,469 --> 00:21:12,679
1, 2, 3, 1, 2, 3, 1, 2, 3... Sit down, sit down!

197
00:21:41,627 --> 00:21:43,427
I'm so sorry, IRyS.

198
00:21:43,427 --> 00:21:47,687
It has been so long.

199
00:21:47,687 --> 00:21:53,647
Nerissa, I'm so, so sorry this happened to you.

200
00:21:53,647 --> 00:21:55,017
It was not my intention.

201
00:21:55,017 --> 00:21:56,587
What do you mean?

202
00:21:56,587 --> 00:21:58,287
What was not your intention?

203
00:21:58,287 --> 00:22:03,887
This... you being... then the witch and... Kiara too.

204
00:22:03,887 --> 00:22:08,167
What? Are you saying you sent the phoenix here to slay me?

205
00:22:08,167 --> 00:22:13,127
No, I didn't! Well, yes, but it was not my intention.

206
00:22:13,127 --> 00:22:16,487
IRyS, what are you trying to tell me?

207
00:22:16,487 --> 00:22:19,807
That you tried to kill me?

208
00:22:19,807 --> 00:22:26,847
You were supposed to be my friend! We've been friends since the beginning!

209
00:22:26,847 --> 00:22:27,807
Yes, of course—

210
00:22:27,807 --> 00:22:29,807
You sent Kiara to kill me?!

211
00:22:29,955 --> 00:22:30,635
No, no.

212
00:22:30,635 --> 00:22:31,365
Then what?

213
00:22:31,645 --> 00:22:36,195
Be clear. Or is this how you greet your beloved friend after so long?

214
00:22:36,325 --> 00:22:46,255
No, I... I would never send someone to kill you. But yes, I'm still your loyal friend. I always have been, and always will be.

215
00:22:46,815 --> 00:22:54,035
I tried to free you, and I did. I sent the witch here to free you, and she did. But I didn't know she was friends with Kiara, and when she felt threatened...

216
00:22:54,035 --> 00:22:59,355
I thought she would come alone. This was not supposed to happen. It was not my intention.

217
00:23:02,335 --> 00:23:06,675
You sent a witch to free me? Why would you send one who binds my kind for power?

218
00:23:11,795 --> 00:23:22,795
Of all those in the world, a witch? Why not send one of my most beloved followers? Only they are said to be able to free me.

219
00:23:23,135 --> 00:23:25,475
Explain yourself. What's going on?

220
00:23:27,765 --> 00:23:35,245
I'm... I'm sorry. I have a lot to explain, but we don't have time now. We need to go. Now!

221
00:23:35,375 --> 00:23:36,895
Death is coming for you.

222
00:23:37,095 --> 00:23:37,655
What?

223
00:23:37,815 --> 00:23:45,165
Please, come with me. I know a way in which we can hide from death, but we have to leave now before it's too late.

224
00:23:45,315 --> 00:23:49,535
I'm not going anywhere with you until you explain to me what is going on!

225
00:23:51,655 --> 00:23:56,895
Now! Why would you send a witch to free me, IRyS?

226
00:23:56,975 --> 00:23:58,895
Nerissa, I had no choice.

227
00:23:59,075 --> 00:24:03,875
You had no choice? You could have sent one of my followers instead!

228
00:24:04,115 --> 00:24:09,655
You don't have any more followers. They're all dead. They all died long ago.

229
00:24:10,395 --> 00:24:11,755
What?

230
00:24:12,975 --> 00:24:15,935
No, that... that can't be.

231
00:24:16,755 --> 00:24:18,495
Has it been that long?

232
00:24:19,355 --> 00:24:30,035
It's been over a thousand years since you've been locked away, and your followers... they're all gone now. It's been many long years since your name was whispered in these lands.

233
00:24:30,635 --> 00:24:36,755
You mean... they no longer love me?

234
00:24:38,135 --> 00:24:55,015
I... I'm sorry. I tried to free you as fast as I could. I really did. But it took a long time to work out how to free you, and there was so much going on, and the gods weren't about to look kindly on any trying to undo their work either. I'm sorry, I don't have time to explain everything right now.

235
00:24:59,175 --> 00:25:03,118
I understand. But IRyS...

236
00:26:46,461 --> 00:26:49,181
[Title: Missing Promise]

237
00:27:00,231 --> 00:27:07,191
遠ざかり始めた その背中はもう振り返らない
The back that started walking away will never turn back again...

238
00:27:09,898 --> 00:27:19,131
長い夜が明けても 過ちと罪は 今もずっと消えずに
Even as the long night breaks, wrongs and sins still never fade away...

239
00:27:20,151 --> 00:27:26,351
落ちる夕陽 闇が忍び寄り 黒く染まってゆく純粋 想うほどに どうして傷で試した
The falling sunset, creeping darkness dyeing purity black... The more I cared, why did I test it with wounds?

240
00:27:32,671 --> 00:27:37,701
欲しかったのは唯一つ その笑顔なのに
What I wanted was just that single smile...

241
00:27:38,201 --> 00:27:45,121
何度間違い続けた日々を 解いて結び直すように
As if untying and re-tying the days of endless mistakes...

242
