いつの間に忘れていた
Which I had somehow forgotten...

244
00:27:55,051 --> 00:27:58,171
その優しい声を探して
Searching for that gentle voice.

245
00:27:59,011 --> 00:28:04,671
また手を取り合えたなら 君ともう一度約束を
If we could hold hands once more, I'd make a promise with you once again...

246
00:28:10,881 --> 00:28:17,321
途切れそうな可能性 見失わないように追いかけて
Chasing after it so I wouldn't lose sight of the fading possibility...

247
00:28:20,881 --> 00:28:29,481
手に入れたものなら 理想とは違う どこか欠けた愛情
What I obtained was a love different from my ideals, lacking something somewhere...

248
00:28:30,791 --> 00:28:37,001
怒り嘆き 歪めたままぶつけ合う逆さまの言葉
Hurting each other with distorted, backward words of anger and grief...

249
00:28:37,651 --> 00:28:43,181
想うほどに どうして許せなかった?
The more I cared, why couldn't I forgive?

250
00:28:43,301 --> 00:28:48,091
守りたかった笑顔を 気づけば壊して
Before I knew it, I had shattered the smile I wanted to protect.

251
00:28:49,111 --> 00:28:55,261
たとえすれ違い離れてても 君を信じられたなら
Even if we passed each other and drifted apart, if I could have believed in you...

252
00:28:56,111 --> 00:29:02,761
また会える日が来たかな 二人懐かしい顔で
Perhaps the day we could meet again would come, with our nostalgic faces...

253
00:29:03,051 --> 00:29:08,901
何気なく過ごしていた あの時間を思い返すなら
If I look back on that time we spent so casually...

254
00:29:09,411 --> 00:29:17,891
ありのまま通じ合えてた まるで運命かのように
We were able to understand each other just as we are, as if it were destiny...

255
00:29:22,271 --> 00:29:33,071
失くしたものがもう戻らないこと わかってても 願いをかけること止められはしない
Even knowing it might be something lost and never returning, I cannot stop wishing upon it...

256
