They're jealous... of me! Spiteful... that I was loved more!

286
00:35:50,813 --> 00:35:56,473
Again, you cannot see past your own desires. The gods took pity on you and your kind.

287
00:35:56,893 --> 00:36:09,333
When I created you, the first demon, the gods felt it unjust and dangerous for such a being to exist for the sole purpose of watching over the surface in my stead...

288
