To be mindless... soulless.

289
00:36:11,933 --> 00:36:23,473
So... they gave the demon a psyche, and plucked it from my deepest and blackest halls, freeing it to roam amongst the two worlds whenever it pleased.

290
00:36:24,013 --> 00:36:32,673
I warned them that the demonic nature was too strong and dangerous to give such desires, and far too dangerous for such a being to exist alongside mortals.

291
00:36:32,953 --> 00:36:44,553
But... the others persisted. And now... here we are. My unheeded warnings leading us back to where it all started.

292
00:36:44,973 --> 00:37:03,273
You almost plunged the world into chaos due to your unbridled lust for adoration. Time and time again you gave in to your nature, banishing you to avoid was supposed to be a chance for you to reflect on your past, but it's only proven that you are truly unfit for this world.
You almost plunged the world into chaos due to your unbridled lust for adoration. Time and time again you gave in to your nature. Banishment into the void was supposed to be a chance for you to reflect on your past... but it's only proven that you are truly unfit for this world.

